<title>HONG KONG: Trade in CNT Group shares suspended.</title>
<headline>Trade in CNT Group shares suspended.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-03-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trading in shares of CNT Group Ltd was suspended at its own request, pending an announcement, the Hong Kong Stock Exchange said on Friday.  </p>
<p>The company shares rose HK$0.04 to end at HK$0.97 on Thursday. Volume was 200.63 million shares worth HK$197.75 million.</p>
<p>CNT Group is a paint manufacturer.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong News Room (852) 2843 6370</p>
